Package: singlehitapp
Title: Shiny App for the 'singlehit' Dose-Response Package
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sean", "Thimons", email = "thimons.sean@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: A golem-based Shiny interface to the 'singlehit' package. It
    imports grouped dose-response data and exposes the package's model fits,
    diagnostics, and plots interactively. The app uses only exported
    'singlehit' functions.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/seanthimons/singlehit/tree/main/app
BugReports: https://github.com/seanthimons/singlehit/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    bslib,
    config,
    esquisse (>= 2.0.0),
    generics,
    ggplot2,
    golem,
    readr,
    shiny,
    singlehit (>= 0.2.0)
Suggests:
    pkgload,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Remotes:
    seanthimons/singlehit
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
